The DIRECT diagnostic does not consume learned Q1/Q2 outputs. With the pilot’s shared reference, replacing the whole score with DIRECT would disconnect both routes; retaining Q2 additively would preserve only Q2’s score path. A direct readout could consume the original route outputs, but that would introduce a new trained component and require new deployment evidence.
